---
---

<section id="top" class="bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--ink-text)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 pb-14 md:pt-24 md:pb-16">
    <p class="font-mono-ui text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--ink-accent)] uppercase">
      Dikshant Savant
    </p>
    <p class="font-mono-ui mt-2 text-xs tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)] uppercase">
      Product builder &middot; Founder
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-8 max-w-[20ch] pb-1 text-5xl leading-[1.08] font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-7xl">
      I like taking an idea and <em class="text-[var(--ink-accent)] not-italic">seeing if I can make it work</em>.
    </h1>

    <div class="mt-9 grid gap-10 border-t border-[var(--ink-border)] pt-9 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:items-end">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex max-w-[48ch] flex-col gap-4 text-lg leading-[1.6] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)]">
          <p>
            Sometimes that means building the product. Sometimes it's
            figuring out how to find customers. Sometimes I end up learning
            a completely random technical thing because it's the only thing
            blocking me.
          </p>
          <p>
            I've built products, websites, automation systems, outbound
            pipelines, and e-commerce brands. Most of them started with me
            trying to solve a problem I had myself.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
          <a
            href="#work"
            class="rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--accent-contrast)] transition-transform active:scale-[0.98]"
            style="background: var(--accent)"
          >
            See what I've built
          </a>
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="rounded-full border border-white/30 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--ink-text)] transition-colors hover:border-white hover:bg-white/[0.06] active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            Get in touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--ink-border)] pb-3">
          <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)] uppercase">Based in</span>
          <span class="text-right text-[var(--ink-text)]">India &middot; Working remotely</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--ink-border)] pb-3">
          <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)] uppercase">Currently working on</span>
          <span class="max-w-[24ch] text-right text-[var(--ink-text)]">Capablanca AI, NeverMissABooking, Our Inner Universe</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
          <span class="font-mono-ui text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--ink-text-muted)] uppercase">How I work</span>
          <span class="max-w-[24ch] text-right text-[var(--ink-text)]">Make something useful. Put it in front of real people. Fix what breaks. Keep going.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
